OL,3,GNEWSATop honour for radiologist after
OL,4,Amore than 30 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who began working in
OL,7,Fradiography at hospitals more than 30
OL,8,Fyears ago has been made president of
OL,9,Fthe Society and College of
OL,10,FRadiographers (SoR), one of the
OL,11,Fprofession's highest honours.
OL,13,FRachel Nolan, assistant imaging
OL,14,Fservices and professional lead at North
OL,15,FWest Anglia NHS Foundation Trust,
OL,16,Fbecame the SoR's 89th president.
OL,18,FShe began her training at 19, and her
OL,19,Ffirst job was in January 1990 at the
OL,20,FEdith Cavell Hospital in Peterborough.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,379,370,200,160,0,100
