OL,3,GNEWSATop honour for radiologist after
OL,4,Amore than 30 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FNolan said: Becoming president of the
OL,7,Fsociety... is something I would never
OL,8,Fhave dreamed of as a 19-year-old
OL,9,Fstarting my training. I've had many
OL,10,Fproud moments during my career, but
OL,11,Fthis is definitely the pinnacle."
